{"4422130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BrakeLess2D", "steam_appid": 4422130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422130/extras/cfc4c4c7f06099d43930a77256f8dd09.avif?t=1780507458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422130/extras_big/cfc4c4c7f06099d43930a77256f8dd09.avif?t=1780507458 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BrakeLess2D</strong> is a minimalist 2D side-scrolling racing game that challenges you to master speed, precision, and timing. Drive your car across dynamic platform tracks, jump ramps, perform flips, and discover the fastest lines to finish each course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the best times on global leaderboards, unlock achievements, and push your skills to the limit. With clean, colorful, flat visuals and fun physics-driven gameplay, every level is a new speedrun challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 2D side-scrolling racing action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422130/extras/d6e1c2fbe66858b4db01c4a5e9a49c92.poster.avif?t=1780507458\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422130/extras/d6e1c2fbe66858b4db01c4a5e9a49c92.webm?t=1780507458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422130/extras/d6e1c2fbe66858b4db01c4a5e9a49c92.mp4?t=1780507458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging 